   "licence": "The package is ODC-PDDL-1.0 for its maintainers' own work only. The codes are facts; the names come from the UN Statistics Division (M49), whose terms were not checked on the M49 page itself.",
   "usedFor": "each country's two-letter code, and the UN's name for it"
  }
